{"path":"container/array/fill","title":"std::array<T,N>::fill","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::array&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>fill","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/array/fill","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns the value to all elements in the container.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> fill<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> to all elements in the container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the value to assign to the elements\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in the size of the container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;array&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstddef&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> xy <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Cell <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Cell, xy <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> xy<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> board<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    board.<span class=\"me1\">fill</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu12\">0xE2</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x96</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x84</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0xE2</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x96</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x80</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// \"▄▀\";</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> count<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> Cell c <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> board<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c.<span class=\"me1\">data</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">++</span>count <span class=\"sy2\">%</span> xy<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀\n▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀\n▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀\n▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/fill\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fill</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copy-assigns the given value to every element in a range <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/fill_n\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fill_n</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copy-assigns the given value to N elements in a range <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/fill\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::fill</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> assigns a range of elements a certain value<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(algorithm function object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/array","title":"std::array"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::array<T,N>::fill","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Assigns the value to all elements in the container."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"value"},{"label